| S1-k | **ACCEPT** |
| SP | **ACCEPT WITH FIXES** — retain divisibility; remove classification/equivalence language |
| SP-D | **ACCEPT WITH FIXES** — clarify sign and exponent product |
| LP | **ACCEPT WITH FIXES** — truncate powers; explain weighted BV |
| SP-U | **ACCEPT** — displayed counting inequality |
| SP-U1 | **ACCEPT WITH FIXES** — spans, density loss, narrower extensions |
| SP-U2 | **REJECT** — current average-case conclusion is unproved |
| SP-N | **ACCEPT WITH FIXES** — specify density threshold and pair counting |
| R | **ACCEPT WITH FIXES** — preprocessing and useful-density scope |
| DIV | **REJECT as stated** — final outputs lose intermediate checks |
